flowchart LR
  Plan[PLAN] --> Graph[TASK_GRAPH]
  Graph --> Patch[SOURCE_PATCH or domain artifact]
  Patch --> Build[BUILD / render / result]
  Build --> Test[TEST_REPORT]
  Test --> Verify[VERIFICATION_REPORT]
  Verify --> Critique[CRITIQUE_REPORT]
  Critique --> Quality[QUALITY_SCORE]
  Quality --> Delivery[FINAL_DELIVERY]
  Any[Every artifact] -. digest + provenance + limitations .-> Record[ArtifactRecord]
  Record -. supersedes without overwrite .-> Any
